					<h2 class="clr-black fw-bold mb-3">Bankers Group of Hospitals: Commitment to Excellence in Healthcare and Community Well-being</h2>
					<p>Established in 2004 with the founding of Bankers Heart Institute, a pioneering super-specialty cardiac center, Bankers Group of Hospitals has evolved into a comprehensive healthcare network dedicated to providing exceptional medical care. Originating with a single facility and 44 employees, the group now encompasses four multi-specialty hospitals, over 1000 professionals, 350+ beds, a Nursing and Technical Institute, and numerous outreach centers across the region.</p>
					<p>Guided by the mission, "Redefining Healthcare through Innovative Technology with Dedicated Human Touch," and the vision, "One Man, One Vision, One Heart, One Mission," Bankers Group of Hospitals prioritizes patient-centric care delivered by a team of highly qualified physicians, paramedical staff, and support personnel.</p>
					
				</div>
