				<div class="col-12 pt-4 text-lg-start text-center">
										<p>Under the leadership of Dr. Parul Banker, Medical Director, and Dr. Darshan Banker, the organization upholds a commitment to:</p>

					<ul style="list-style: disc" class="ps-3 text-start">
												<li><strong>Superior Medical Care:</strong> Providing access to state-of-the-art infrastructure and cutting-edge medical technologies, including IVUS, FFR, OCT, ECMO, TAVR, and renal denervation, ensuring patients receive the most advanced treatments available.</li>

						<li><strong>Emphasis on Life-Saving Skills:</strong> Actively promoting and providing training in Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) to enhance community preparedness and improve survival rates in cardiac emergencies.</li>

						<li><strong>Community Engagement and Social Responsibility:</strong> Implementing a robust Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) program focused on community health, awareness, and financial assistance for underserved populations. This initiative, driven by the belief that "medical care should not be a privilege to a few, but accessible to all," has positively impacted over 200,000 beneficiaries and received numerous accolades.</li>
						<li><strong>Technological Advancement and Academic Excellence:</strong> Dr. Darshan Banker's dedication to medical technology, surgical innovation, and academic pursuits has positioned Bankers Group of Hospitals as a leader in adopting and implementing novel medical techniques.</li>
						<li><strong>Dedicated Human Touch:</strong> Maintaining a compassionate and empathetic approach to patient care, ensuring that advanced technology is complemented by personalized attention and support.</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="mt-3">Bankers Group of Hospitals remains committed to elevating healthcare standards, fostering community well-being, and advancing medical innovation, thereby fulfilling its mission to deliver exceptional care with both technological sophistication and genuine human compassion.</p>

